### ============================================================
### StayFinder API – testanrop (REST Client i VS Code)
### Hemligheter ligger i .env (TEST_EMAIL, TEST_PASSWORD)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = {{$dotenv TEST_EMAIL}}
@password = {{$dotenv TEST_PASSWORD}}
@missingId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000


### ============================================================
### 0. NEKAD UTAN INLOGGNING (G6, G14)
### Kör först, innan du loggat in (eller logga ut först).
### ============================================================

### /auth/me utloggad → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Skapa boende utloggad → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nekat boende",
  "description": "Ska nekas",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1000,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": null
}

### Ändra boende utloggad → 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{missingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nekat",
  "description": "Ska nekas",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1000,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": null
}

### Ta bort boende utloggad → 401
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{missingId}}

### Lista bokningar utloggad → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings

### Skapa bokning utloggad → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{missingId}}",
  "guest_name": "Test",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 2
}


### ============================================================
### G1. KONTO OCH INLOGGNING
### ============================================================

### Skapa konto → 201 (ändra om din route svarar 200)
### Skapar ett nytt konto per körning, eftersom adressen har tidsstämpel.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stayfinder-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Logga in med fel lösenord → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "fel-losenord-123"
}

### Logga in (testkontot) → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### G2. Vem är inloggad → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me


### ============================================================
### G6 / G14. BOENDEN: SKAPA OCH ÄNDRA (inloggad)
### ============================================================

### Skapa boende → 201
# @name createProperty
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Testboende",
  "description": "Skapat av api-tests.http",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1200,
  "max_guests": 4,
  "image_url": null
}

### Skapa boende med ogiltig data (negativt pris, saknad titel) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Saknar titel",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": -5,
  "max_guests": 4,
  "image_url": null
}

### Ändra boende → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Testboende (ändrat)",
  "description": "Ändrat av api-tests.http",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1300,
  "max_guests": 4,
  "image_url": null
}

### Ändra boende som inte finns → 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{missingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finns inte",
  "description": "Ska ge 404",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1000,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": null
}


### ============================================================
### G4. LISTA OCH DETALJ (öppet för alla)
### ============================================================

### Lista alla boenden → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties

### Detalj för ett boende → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.id}}

### Detalj för boende som inte finns → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{missingId}}


### ============================================================
### G5. FILTRERING
### ============================================================

### Filtrera på stad (delmatch) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?city=stock

### Filtrera på maxpris → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?maxPrice=1500

### Filtrera på antal gäster → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?guests=3

### Kombinera alla filter → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?city=stock&maxPrice=2000&guests=2

### Ogiltigt maxPrice (negativt) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?maxPrice=-5

### Ogiltigt antal gäster (0) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?guests=0


### ============================================================
### G8. SORTERING PÅ PRIS (görs i backend)
### ============================================================

### Billigast först → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?sort=price&order=asc

### Dyrast först → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?sort=price&order=desc

### Ogiltigt sorteringsfält → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?sort=name


### ============================================================
### G10 / G14. BOKNINGAR: OGILTIGA FALL
### ============================================================

### Ogiltig e-post → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "inte-en-epost",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 2
}

### Noll gäster → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 0
}

### Utcheckning före incheckning → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-05",
  "check_out": "2026-12-01",
  "guests": 2
}

### Fler gäster än boendets max (4) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 5
}

### Boende som inte finns → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{missingId}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 2
}


### ============================================================
### G12 / G14. BOKNINGAR: SKAPA, SE, ÄNDRA, TA BORT
### ============================================================

### Skapa bokning → 201
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 2
}

### Lista bokningar för boendet → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?property_id={{createProperty.response.body.id}}

### Ogiltigt property_id i filtret → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?property_id=inte-ett-uuid

### Hämta en bokning → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}

### Bokning som inte finns → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{missingId}}

### Ändra bokning → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-02",
  "check_out": "2026-12-06",
  "guests": 3
}

### Ändra bokning med för många gäster → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-02",
  "check_out": "2026-12-06",
  "guests": 5
}

### Ändra bokning som inte finns → 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{missingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_id": "{{createProperty.response.body.id}}",
  "guest_name": "Test Testsson",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-02",
  "check_out": "2026-12-06",
  "guests": 2
}

### Ta bort bokning → 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}

### Ta bort samma bokning igen → 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}


### ============================================================
### STÄDNING
### ============================================================

### Ta bort testboendet → 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.id}}

### Ta bort boendet igen → 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.id}}

### Logga ut → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout